   "id": "e5a551e1e91397a7"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Fuel tax credits fight\nEscalating. $50M-cap proposal; **Fortescue split** weakens \"miners vs activists\". Watch MYEFO.",
   "x": 180,
   "y": -560,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 150,
   "color": "1",
   "id": "365638ab04b67d78"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Critical minerals tailwind\n$1.2B strategic reserve; US/Japan pacts \u2014 security framing available.",
   "x": 180,
   "y": -390,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 130,
   "color": "4",
   "id": "8aace96352823764"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Cost-of-living squeeze\nRBA holding 4.35%, inflation sticky, more hikes possible. Economic-security framing outperforms partisan framing.",
   "x": 180,
   "y": -240,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 150,
   "color": "5",
   "id": "18ba293adb3b93b4"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Weak-government window\nLabor primary 26-28% (contested by pollster); public mood hardening on migration/diversity.",
   "x": 180,
   "y": -70,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "3",
   "id": "50e7a6d66cec167e"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Minerals Council of Australia (`mca`)\nCampaigns: **Hands Off Our Fuel**, That\u2019s Mining, Critical Minerals.\nPlaybooks to write: style \u00b7 voice \u00b7 policy.",
   "x": -1200,
   "y": 60,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "5",
   "id": "ba968776776f913d"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Shared layer (`cmm`)\nAgency-wide doctrine, macro context, cross-client intelligence.",
   "x": -1200,
   "y": 260,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 130,
   "id": "408ac927213955ca"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## The Curious Mind\nVectorize index the app retrieves from.\nFed by `tools/vault2mind.py` + in-app ingest.",
   "x": -520,
   "y": 80,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 150,
   "color": "3",
   "id": "4e53b401c5d02cd6"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "## Outcomes (WIN/LOSS)\nApprove/Kill verdicts from Ad Lab & Studio retrieve into every future brief.",
   "x": -520,
   "y": 260,
   "width": 540,
   "height": 140,
   "color": "1",
   "id": "a638802a82084e6a"
  }
 ],
